    "return/manifest.json"
   ],
   "reproducibility": "FastEddy is not bitwise reproducible run-to-run on one GPU (~1e-4 relative in velocity), and will not be across different physical GPUs either. Seeds are turbulence realisations; do not diff two of them."
  }
 ]
}